{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"ff9ad2bbc3c77fed98616bc4fd0b0d90199df4093876c7ede59417938bb1d63e","occurred_at":"2026-11-27T20:05:15Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[1077,1078]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"        unit_dir = (Path(os.environ.get(\n            \"XDG_CONFIG_HOME\", str(Path.home() / \".config\"))) / \"systemd/user\")","reason":"The code only falls back to $HOME/.config when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset. If XDG_CONFIG_HOME is empty or relative, Path(...) yields a relative unit_dir (e.g. systemd/user), contrary to XDG base-directory semantics. The current contract does not retire this behavior, and this is an ordinary correctness defect in the intended host-layout composition.","target":"1d6d7bbe3710b41a9be5772e27565273447635f0"},"finding_id":"1f96a1af27aa0b0b0b6a651ff091eee687cc84d97278d23b0300cdb3b5976962","previous_event_id":"2d1e106fe55e51d770fea62d08c70fba37ff4bb6c7f0a0a8c3408909f6418df6","review_id":"9a9770d007f4898ae9f169624c7b761856e1e349d118670986a85a8250d506cd"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:1f96a1af27aa0b0b0b6a651ff091eee687cc84d97278d23b0300cdb3b5976962:e30a34a59bd32b599683049d62d76038fdde3157c360c230dd57e1404e3742fa"}